# sources -- unlike the probe_*/san_*/perf_* files, these are not part of the suite.
*_tmp
*_tmp.cu
bench_u_*
bench_w_*
sass_*
tw_*
fill_s*
one_BASE
one_HOIST
check_BASE
check_HOIST
check_def
check_off

